>> title: Teriyaki Sauce
>> category: Sauces & Gravies
>> tags: soy, japanese, glaze, chicken, stovetop
>> counters: Ramen Shop, Takeout Counter, Japanese Home Cooking
>> aka: teriyaki, teriyaki glaze, chicken teriyaki sauce
>> servings: 8
>> time: 25 min
>> step.1: simmer until the sugar dissolves
>> step.2: steep 5 min
>> step.3: reduce 10 min to a glaze
>> step.4: finish and strain

Simmer @soy sauce{1/2%cup}(120 mL), @mirin{1/2%cup}(120 mL), @sake{1/4%cup}(60 mL), and @sugar{3%Tbs}(40 g) in a #small saucepan{} until the sugar dissolves.

Steep @fresh ginger{1%in piece}(sliced) and @garlic{2%cloves}(smashed) in @&(~1)base{} for ~{5%min}.

Reduce @&(~1)sauce{} for ~{10%min}, until it turns glossy and coats the back of a spoon.

Finish @&(~1)glaze{} with @toasted sesame oil{1/2%tsp} and strain out the aromatics.
